WEBVTT

00:01.750 --> 00:03.460
<b>Desperate to avoid doing
any harm to his brother,</b>

00:03.460 --> 00:06.000
<b>Cless takes his own life.</b>

00:06.000 --> 00:09.670
<b>But the pain of watching Cless die causes
Helck to let his power go out of control.</b>

00:10.080 --> 00:11.750
<b>He drowns in a pool of despair,</b>

00:11.750 --> 00:15.920
<b>but manages to pick himself back up after
hearing that his friends are still alive.</b>

00:17.580 --> 00:19.420
<b>I'm not giving up.</b>

00:19.420 --> 00:21.830
<b>I'm never going to give up no matter what!</b>

00:22.170 --> 00:25.000
<b>This time... things will be different!</b>

00:43.500 --> 00:46.040
<b>Aa, touzen mitai ni tsuyosa kazashite</b>

00:46.040 --> 00:48.210
<b>Noudo mashiteku rettoukanjou</b>

00:48.210 --> 00:50.170
<b>Umareta toki kara</b>

00:50.170 --> 00:52.330
<b>Kimatterutte oshietoite yo</b>

00:52.330 --> 00:54.080
<b>Risoukyou no otonari san</b>

00:54.080 --> 00:56.290
<b>Zetsubou ga sa hora "konnichiwa"</b>

00:56.290 --> 00:58.330
<b>Daremo kizukanai no wa</b>

00:58.330 --> 01:00.500
<b>Kou ka fukou ka?</b>

01:00.500 --> 01:03.750
<b>Nando mezamete mo</b>

01:03.750 --> 01:06.880
<b>Akumu no you dana</b>

01:06.880 --> 01:10.250
<b>Kurushii dake nara</b>

01:10.580 --> 01:12.380
<b>Kamisama douka boku o tsukurikaete kuranai ka</b>

01:12.380 --> 01:16.290
<b>Kamisama douka boku o tsukurikaete kuranai ka</b>

01:16.290 --> 01:18.420
<b>Aa, nanmannen mo bokura wa</b>

01:18.420 --> 01:21.000
<b>Mirai ni kibou idakinagara</b>

01:21.000 --> 01:22.880
<b>Douse otozureru ketsumatsu ni</b>

01:22.880 --> 01:25.170
<b>Aragou to surun da</b>

01:25.170 --> 01:26.830
<b>Nankai me no inori da</b>

01:26.830 --> 01:29.170
<b>Kokoro karada kawari hatete</b>

01:29.170 --> 01:33.580
<b>Magamono datte nan datte shinjitakute</b>

01:33.710 --> 01:37.080
<b>Are, boku wa ima ikiteru no?</b>

01:37.080 --> 01:39.830
<b>Mou wake wakannai ya</b>

01:39.830 --> 01:41.830
<b>Helck me tasukete yo</b>

01:55.080 --> 02:00.000
<b>Smile</b>

02:05.080 --> 02:06.330
<b>It's Helck!</b>

02:07.040 --> 02:08.750
<b>Helck the Hero Slayer!</b>

02:08.750 --> 02:10.460
<b>The traitorous bastard!</b>

02:11.670 --> 02:13.670
<b>They don't care if we bring him back
dead or alive!</b>

02:13.670 --> 02:15.710
<b>The bounty's still the same
even if he's a corpse!</b>

02:16.130 --> 02:17.380
<b>Kill him!</b>

02:17.380 --> 02:18.170
<b>I'm gonna end him!</b>

02:18.170 --> 02:19.040
<b>No, I will!</b>

02:19.040 --> 02:20.170
<b>Not if I get to him first!</b>

02:20.170 --> 02:21.080
<b>He's mine!</b>

02:33.750 --> 02:36.210
<b>Get the carriage moving!
We need to get away from the capital!</b>

02:36.460 --> 02:37.670
<b>Zeruzeon!</b>

02:38.540 --> 02:39.830
<b>Where's Sir Cless?</b>

02:39.830 --> 02:41.670
<b>Weren't you guys
supposed to rescue him?!</b>

02:42.960 --> 02:45.170
<b>Haraoul... Cless is...</b>

02:50.040 --> 02:52.500
<b>Wh-what causes a wound like this?!</b>

02:52.500 --> 02:54.670
<b>Stand aside! I'll stop the bleeding!</b>

02:54.670 --> 02:57.250
<b>Don't back down! He's just one guy!</b>

03:00.040 --> 03:01.170
<b>Helck!</b>

03:02.920 --> 03:04.670
<b>You can't die on us now!</b>

03:04.670 --> 03:05.960
<b>Hang in there!</b>

03:12.750 --> 03:15.130
<b>You want us to fly the coop
and leave you behind?</b>

03:15.130 --> 03:17.500
<b>We're not letting you
shoulder the burden alone, cap!</b>

03:17.500 --> 03:20.710
<b>Yeah, you've gotta be kidding!
Helck has saved our asses a million times!</b>

03:20.710 --> 03:23.210
<b>So this time it's
our turn to save him, right?</b>

03:23.210 --> 03:26.330
<b>You should know none of us are the type
to just abandon a friend and run!</b>

03:27.710 --> 03:30.460
<b>Yeah. We're with you until the very end.</b>

03:36.880 --> 03:40.380
<b>What the hell?
How is this guy so strong?</b>

03:40.670 --> 03:44.130
<b>Did they lie to us when they said
he was seriously injured?</b>

03:44.130 --> 03:46.210
<b>There they are! It's the traitors!</b>

03:46.580 --> 03:48.330
<b>Don't let them escape!</b>

03:48.330 --> 03:49.540
<b>I'll act as a decoy!</b>

03:49.880 --> 03:52.130
<b>Use that time to escape from the castle!</b>

03:52.130 --> 03:54.500
<b>Pass on a message to Helck
for me when he wakes up.</b>

03:54.920 --> 03:58.210
<b>Tell him that I'm really sorry
things ended up this way...</b>

04:07.130 --> 04:08.630
<b>I'm not giving up!</b>

04:10.330 --> 04:11.250
<b>Shit!</b>

04:11.250 --> 04:12.960
<b>Here comes a squadron of kingdom soldiers!</b>

04:12.960 --> 04:14.250
<b>Damn! Guess that's it for us.</b>

04:14.250 --> 04:15.830
<b>We can't compete with
the likes of th-</b>

04:15.830 --> 04:17.710
<b>Huh?! W-wait a second!</b>

04:17.710 --> 04:19.580
<b>How many of them did they send?!</b>

04:19.580 --> 04:22.170
<b>And look, that infamous hitman
is with them...</b>

04:22.170 --> 04:24.290
<b>Holy crap, he's still alive?!</b>

04:27.210 --> 04:28.420
<b>Goddammit!</b>

04:28.420 --> 04:29.830
<b>Those heartless bastards!</b>

04:29.830 --> 04:32.000
<b>They threw us to the dogs
after we protected their town!</b>

04:32.000 --> 04:34.250
<b>Bring it! We mercs don't go down easy!</b>

04:34.250 --> 04:36.790
<b>You guys go on ahead!
We've got your back!</b>

04:36.960 --> 04:39.460
<b>Take care of Helck, okay?</b>

04:39.710 --> 04:42.380
<b>Catch ya later. Stay safe out there!</b>

04:46.460 --> 04:47.960
<b>I'm not giving up!</b>

05:04.130 --> 05:06.380
<b>This is bad. They're still hunting us!</b>

05:06.920 --> 05:09.130
<b>There should be an
abandoned coal mine to the northwest.</b>

05:09.130 --> 05:10.580
<b>We'll have to head there!</b>

05:10.880 --> 05:12.170
<b>Thank you.</b>

05:12.170 --> 05:14.750
<b>You've always been like
a real big brother to me.</b>

05:15.830 --> 05:18.080
<b>Please... stay alive!</b>

05:22.670 --> 05:24.670
<b>Found them! They're over there!</b>

05:24.670 --> 05:27.290
<b>Come and get it! I'll take you on!</b>

05:31.670 --> 05:33.000
<b>I'm not giving up!</b>

05:33.130 --> 05:35.670
<b>I'm never going to give up no matter what!</b>

05:43.790 --> 05:44.830
<b>Please.</b>

05:48.960 --> 05:50.580
<b>You have to survive...</b>

05:53.500 --> 05:54.790
<b>Helck.</b>

06:00.000 --> 06:01.130
<b>Helck.</b>

06:02.670 --> 06:06.000
<b>I WON'T EVER GIVE UP!</b>

06:18.250 --> 06:20.130
<b>What a pain in the ass.</b>

06:21.250 --> 06:23.580
<b>Actually kill me, dammit.</b>

06:27.250 --> 06:28.580
<b>What are you...</b>

06:28.580 --> 06:30.920
<b>Helck the Hero Slayer.</b>

06:30.920 --> 06:34.250
<b>I didn't think the gap between us
would be so friggin' wide.</b>

06:35.000 --> 06:37.130
<b>But I won't lose next time!</b>

06:37.630 --> 06:40.920
<b>I'm gonna catch up to you...
sooner or lat-</b>

06:51.170 --> 06:52.420
<b>Die!</b>

06:52.420 --> 06:53.790
<b>Yeah, die already!</b>

06:55.330 --> 06:57.080
<b>Burn in Hell, bitch!</b>

06:57.080 --> 06:59.170
<b>Ah yes, I've heard of this girl.</b>

06:59.170 --> 07:01.670
<b>She's one of those dirty criminals
who've been up to no-good.</b>

07:01.670 --> 07:04.960
<b>She definitely has the look of someone
who thrives upon deceiving others.</b>

07:07.920 --> 07:11.330
<b>I go take a quick break and
just look at the mess I come back to!</b>

07:12.580 --> 07:14.460
<b>Is the bitch still alive?</b>

07:14.460 --> 07:17.250
<b>We can't have her dying on us
before the execution.</b>

07:17.250 --> 07:19.540
<b>She's in bad shape, but still alive, sir.</b>

07:22.380 --> 07:23.420
<b>Hey.</b>

07:24.500 --> 07:26.750
<b>Wanna try begging for mercy?</b>

07:29.080 --> 07:33.540
<b>I'll consider letting you go if you swear
to be my slave for the rest of your life.</b>

07:37.040 --> 07:38.880
<b>It serves you right!</b>

07:39.080 --> 07:41.580
<b>This is what you get for
trying to make me look bad</b>

07:41.580 --> 07:43.170
<b>with all that complaining back then!</b>

07:43.380 --> 07:45.500
<b>Okay! It's time to begin!</b>

07:45.500 --> 07:47.080
<b>Filthy traitor who threatens the peace!</b>

07:47.080 --> 07:48.210
<b>Suffer and die!</b>

07:48.210 --> 07:49.960
<b>Hurry and kill her already!</b>

07:52.790 --> 07:54.250
<b>Helck...</b>

07:58.580 --> 08:01.380
<b>This is the public execution
of a member of Helck's crew!</b>

08:01.380 --> 08:04.500
<b>Alicia the felon will now
get beheaded for her crimes!</b>

08:06.630 --> 08:08.250
<b>Come forth, Executioner!</b>

08:10.380 --> 08:12.460
<b>Just a beheading?
She deserves worse!</b>

08:12.460 --> 08:13.630
<b>Go rot in Hell!</b>

08:13.630 --> 08:14.830
<b>Burn the bitch alive!</b>

08:14.830 --> 08:18.250
<b>Sounds like the people
want you to suffer an even worse fate.</b>

08:18.790 --> 08:19.630
<b>Tell me.</b>

08:19.630 --> 08:21.830
<b>How does it feel to get
treated like absolute garbage</b>

08:21.830 --> 08:24.290
<b>by the very same people
that you risked your life to save?</b>

08:24.540 --> 08:26.540
<b>Should we change
the method of her execution, sir?</b>

08:26.540 --> 08:28.830
<b>No, you dumbass!
Just hurry and kill her!</b>

08:28.830 --> 08:30.670
<b>I have a party to attend tonight!</b>

08:30.670 --> 08:32.250
<b>If the people want to see something else,</b>

08:32.250 --> 08:34.080
<b>then just execute another one
of the traitors later!</b>

08:34.080 --> 08:34.710
<b>Yessir!</b>

08:34.710 --> 08:36.790
<b>No... Stop...</b>

08:38.500 --> 08:41.540
<b>Do it to me... Let me be the one...</b>

08:41.830 --> 08:44.670
<b>Huh? I can't hear anything you're saying!</b>

08:44.670 --> 08:47.080
<b>I'm going to make sure
that all your little merc buddies</b>

08:47.080 --> 08:48.710
<b>suffer far worse deaths than you!</b>

08:48.710 --> 08:49.830
<b>Don't you dare...</b>

08:49.830 --> 08:50.500
<b>Do it!</b>

08:54.920 --> 09:04.750
<b>Kill her! Kill her! Kill her!</b>

09:09.580 --> 09:16.130
<b>Kill her! Kill her! Kill her! Kill her!</b>

09:22.330 --> 09:24.460
<b>Hey! What's the big idea?</b>

09:25.420 --> 09:28.460
<b>Listen, bossman, we gotta call this off.</b>

09:28.460 --> 09:31.170
<b>Or else... it's gonna be bad!</b>

09:31.170 --> 09:32.960
<b>I can feel it in my bones!</b>

09:32.960 --> 09:34.920
<b>Huh? What kind of joke is that?!</b>

09:34.920 --> 09:36.460
<b>Just chop her damn head off!</b>

09:36.460 --> 09:38.290
<b>S-say whatever you want...</b>

09:38.290 --> 09:40.880
<b>but I'm tellin' ya
that it just ain't possible for me!</b>

09:40.880 --> 09:43.250
<b>M-my body's shaking like a leaf!</b>

09:43.250 --> 09:45.750
<b>A-and I can't get it to move!</b>

09:46.500 --> 09:50.040
<b>C'mon, bossman... d-don't you feel it?</b>

09:50.040 --> 09:51.880
<b>It's like, like a w-wave
of pressure in the air...</b>

09:53.330 --> 09:56.000
<b>It feels restricting, and suffocating,</b>

09:56.000 --> 10:00.210
<b>like being dropped down a deep hole
where no light can reach.</b>

10:00.750 --> 10:02.880
<b>Just an awful feeling.</b>

10:10.580 --> 10:12.210
<b>H-Helck!</b>

10:22.460 --> 10:24.420
<b>H-hey! Do something!</b>

10:24.420 --> 10:28.250
<b>Somebody attack! Take him out!</b>

10:29.880 --> 10:34.960
<b>Don't!
I'm a m-member of n-nobility...</b>

10:37.750 --> 10:39.380
<b>Was it you?</b>

10:39.920 --> 10:43.080
<b>Are you the asshole who
put my friend through all this abuse?</b>

10:44.830 --> 10:46.130
<b>How dare you.</b>

10:46.580 --> 10:47.830
<b>How dare you!</b>

10:48.130 --> 10:50.540
<b>N-no! Not me!</b>

10:51.000 --> 10:54.960
<b>It was the people...
they're the ones who... threw rocks...</b>

10:56.080 --> 10:59.670
<b>That's a load of crap! Don't blame us!
We were told that she was a criminal!</b>

10:59.670 --> 11:02.130
<b>W-well, I only threw one rock at her!</b>

11:02.130 --> 11:03.880
<b>We were tricked into doing it!</b>

11:03.880 --> 11:04.540
<b>That's right! He's the one at fault here!</b>

11:04.540 --> 11:06.250
<b>Th-that's wrong... it wasn't me...
</b><b>That's right! He's the one at fault here!</b><b></b>

11:06.250 --> 11:07.670
<b>Th-that's wrong... it wasn't me...
</b><b>We didn't do jack shit!</b><b></b>

11:07.670 --> 11:08.630
<b>Th-that's wrong... it wasn't me...</b>

11:08.630 --> 11:11.960
<b>All these people...
they were enjoying it!</b>

11:11.960 --> 11:14.880
<b>Liar! I didn't actually want to do it!</b>

11:14.880 --> 11:19.290
<b>Please, I beg you... d-don't kill me...</b>

11:22.380 --> 11:23.710
<b>Disgusting.</b>

11:39.130 --> 11:40.880
<b>Helck...</b>

11:41.380 --> 11:44.420
<b>Have you recovered from your wounds?</b>

11:44.420 --> 11:47.250
<b>Yeah. Thanks to you and everyone else.</b>

11:47.250 --> 11:49.420
<b>I'm sorry it took me so long!</b>

11:49.420 --> 11:50.750
<b>It's okay...</b>

11:50.750 --> 11:53.630
<b>I had the feeling you would come.</b>

11:53.630 --> 11:56.080
<b>You really are something else.</b>

11:56.080 --> 11:58.000
<b>You're amazing, Helck...</b>

11:58.000 --> 11:59.710
<b>No, I'm not!</b>

11:59.710 --> 12:02.170
<b>I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!</b>

12:02.170 --> 12:04.960
<b>Why are you apologizing?</b>

12:04.960 --> 12:08.250
<b>You didn't do anything wrong.</b>

12:08.830 --> 12:12.130
<b>Alicia. Let's get out of here.</b>

12:12.130 --> 12:13.880
<b>And go somewhere far away.</b>

12:13.880 --> 12:15.420
<b>Far away?</b>

12:15.420 --> 12:16.500
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:16.670 --> 12:19.920
<b>The demon realm. That's where we'll go.</b>

12:19.920 --> 12:23.330
<b>We'll save everyone else
and then travel there together.</b>

12:23.330 --> 12:24.710
<b>The demon realm?</b>

12:24.710 --> 12:26.750
<b>Remember what we talked about before?</b>

12:26.750 --> 12:29.170
<b>We're going to see what
the demonkin are really like.</b>

12:30.130 --> 12:32.210
<b>Because who knows?</b>

12:32.210 --> 12:34.920
<b>They might actually be
more kindhearted than humans are.</b>

12:36.040 --> 12:38.210
<b>I swear I'll protect you this time.</b>

12:38.210 --> 12:41.000
<b>No matter how dangerous
of a threat we face.</b>

12:41.000 --> 12:42.710
<b>I will keep you safe.</b>

12:43.210 --> 12:44.040
<b>Okay.</b>

12:44.330 --> 12:46.130
<b>I'm with you.</b>

12:46.130 --> 12:49.500
<b>Wherever you go,
I want to be by your side.</b>

12:57.250 --> 12:59.290
<b>Most impressive.</b>

13:00.040 --> 13:03.080
<b>Are you planning to go
and save your other friends now?</b>

13:03.080 --> 13:04.710
<b>Because you should know,</b>

13:04.710 --> 13:07.960
<b>we still have a considerable number
of awakened soldiers inside the castle.</b>

13:14.750 --> 13:17.710
<b>I will take down
whoever tries to stand in my way.</b>

13:17.710 --> 13:19.710
<b>I won't show any mercy this time.</b>

13:22.330 --> 13:24.420
<b>Not even to you.</b>

13:26.290 --> 13:29.500
<b>It seems that I've
underestimated you a little.</b>

13:31.170 --> 13:33.420
<b>I hadn't entertained this possibility.</b>

13:33.420 --> 13:36.130
<b>I was convinced you'd been dropped</b>

13:36.130 --> 13:39.540
<b>so far into the pits of despair that
you would just give up on everything.</b>

13:39.790 --> 13:44.130
<b>However, you clung onto hope
until the very end.</b>

13:44.130 --> 13:47.250
<b>That girl was fated to die and it's clear
to me the reason why she remains alive</b>

13:47.250 --> 13:50.880
<b>is because you saved her
through sheer force of will</b>

13:50.880 --> 13:53.210
<b>thanks to an unwavering desire
to protect your friends.</b>

13:55.040 --> 13:57.330
<b>You've done it.</b>

13:57.330 --> 14:00.880
<b>You've secured a future where
you can protect those you hold dear.</b>

14:04.460 --> 14:08.080
<b>But... we live in a world that
is both incomplete and illogical.</b>

14:08.080 --> 14:10.920
<b>Your strong determination
to make a difference has backfired</b>

14:10.920 --> 14:13.080
<b>and led you down a path
to even greater despair.</b>

14:14.670 --> 14:17.880
<b>You never should have come here.</b>

14:20.540 --> 14:21.630
<b>Alicia!</b>

14:29.290 --> 14:31.380
<b>The awakening has begun.</b>

14:31.750 --> 14:32.880
<b>Despite what happened,</b>

14:32.880 --> 14:37.380
<b>you and your friends didn't
actually stop our plans that day.</b>

14:37.790 --> 14:40.880
<b>It has all proceeded
just as Mikaros intended.</b>

14:50.130 --> 14:52.580
<b>Oh my god. This is awakening?</b>

14:53.170 --> 14:55.460
<b>Every human being alive has
an immense power</b>

14:55.460 --> 14:56.380
<b>that's hidden deep within them.</b>

14:56.380 --> 14:57.920
<b>It's hot! It's hot! It's hot! It's hot!
</b><b>that's hidden deep within them.</b><b></b>

14:57.920 --> 15:00.380
<b>It's hot! It's hot! It's hot! It's hot!
</b><b>The power of heroes.</b><b></b>

15:00.830 --> 15:01.830
<b>And normally,</b>

15:01.830 --> 15:05.960
<b>people just go through their entire lives
without ever awakening that power.</b>

15:05.960 --> 15:08.250
<b>But there are rare cases
such as you and Cless,</b>

15:08.250 --> 15:10.880
<b>where people can tap
into that power naturally.</b>

15:11.500 --> 15:12.920
<b>However, when the power is forcefully</b>

15:12.920 --> 15:13.920
<b>It's hot! It's hot! It's hot!
</b><b>awakened in a normal person,</b><b></b>

15:13.920 --> 15:15.670
<b>It's hot! It's hot! It's hot!
</b><b>they don't end up like you.</b><b></b>

15:15.670 --> 15:17.420
<b>It's hot! It's hot! It's hot!
</b><b>It becomes overwhelming to the point</b><b></b>

15:17.420 --> 15:19.330
<b>they cannot maintain their sense of self,</b>

15:19.330 --> 15:22.710
<b>and their muscles develop enough
to cause their bodies to warp grotesquely.</b>

15:23.040 --> 15:27.040
<b>Their psyche is totally broken,
leaving them with no personality.</b>

15:29.710 --> 15:30.790
<b>No way.</b>

15:31.250 --> 15:32.880
<b>How is this even possible?</b>

15:33.540 --> 15:34.670
<b>Wait!</b>

15:34.670 --> 15:35.920
<b>But then...</b>

15:38.420 --> 15:40.460
<b>If the awakening plan is still happening,</b>

15:40.460 --> 15:42.540
<b>what the hell did
Cless give his life for?!</b>

15:45.290 --> 15:46.330
<b>Alicia!</b>

15:47.880 --> 15:49.290
<b>It's hot! It's hot! It's hot! It's hot!</b>

15:49.290 --> 15:50.460
<b>What's going on?
</b><b>It's hot! It's hot! It's hot! It's hot!</b><b></b>

15:50.460 --> 15:51.960
<b>Why is it effecting Alicia?!
</b><b>It's hot! It's hot! It's hot! It's hot!</b><b></b>

15:53.330 --> 15:55.040
<b>D-don't tell me...</b>

15:56.040 --> 15:57.290
<b>That's right.</b>

15:57.460 --> 16:00.880
<b>This snow is actually a spell that's
causing everyone to awaken.</b>

16:01.540 --> 16:04.420
<b>It contains an element that triggers
the awakening process</b>

16:04.420 --> 16:06.830
<b>whenever a normal human
comes in contact with it.</b>

16:08.420 --> 16:09.330
<b>Don't bother.</b>

16:09.960 --> 16:13.540
<b>There is no material in the world
that's capable of obstructing it.</b>

16:14.080 --> 16:16.000
<b>Not to mention,
it's impossible to escape from the snow</b>

16:16.000 --> 16:18.380
<b>no matter where you may try to go.</b>

16:19.170 --> 16:20.920
<b>It's hot! It's hot!</b>

16:21.210 --> 16:22.330
<b>Dammit!</b>

16:22.580 --> 16:25.960
<b>In due time, this snow will fall
throughout the entire kingdom.</b>

16:25.960 --> 16:28.290
<b>It will effect nobles and commoners alike.</b>

16:28.580 --> 16:31.710
<b>Every human that lives
in the kingdom will awaken,</b>

16:31.710 --> 16:36.080
<b>and then be reborn as organic weapons
that only follow the orders of the king.</b>

16:37.960 --> 16:38.920
<b>Helck, my boy.</b>

16:38.920 --> 16:42.080
<b>You put up a good fight.
You gave it your best.</b>

16:42.080 --> 16:45.580
<b>But now that we've come this far,
there is no going back.</b>

16:46.250 --> 16:47.710
<b>Leave this place.</b>

16:47.710 --> 16:50.250
<b>Otherwise you will end up having
to fight the empty husks</b>

16:50.250 --> 16:52.040
<b>of the people you used to call friends.</b>

16:52.040 --> 16:53.880
<b>Including that girl in your arms.</b>

16:53.880 --> 16:54.630
<b>SHUT UP!</b>

16:55.540 --> 16:57.130
<b>This isn't the end yet!</b>

16:58.250 --> 16:59.880
<b>Like hell I'm giving up!</b>

17:05.830 --> 17:09.330
<b>It seems like this has turned into
a real crazy mess...</b>

17:09.630 --> 17:11.710
<b>Like, I can't even make sense of it...</b>

17:11.710 --> 17:14.630
<b>Hang in there! I'll take you somewhere
without snow soon!</b>

17:14.630 --> 17:17.170
<b>There has to be a place
free of the snowfall!</b>

17:17.170 --> 17:19.130
<b>I'm sorry, Helck...</b>

17:19.130 --> 17:20.880
<b>I think it's too late for me...</b>

17:20.880 --> 17:22.380
<b>Don't talk like that!</b>

17:22.380 --> 17:25.210
<b>Leave me behind... and run away...</b>

17:25.210 --> 17:27.170
<b>No way! You can't give up!</b>

17:28.750 --> 17:29.830
<b>Please!</b>

17:29.830 --> 17:32.170
<b>I don't want you
to see what happens to me!</b>

17:39.420 --> 17:40.540
<b>Alicia...</b>

17:40.540 --> 17:41.920
<b>Stay strong!</b>

17:41.920 --> 17:43.790
<b>Don't let this thing beat you!</b>

17:44.040 --> 17:46.750
<b>Helck... promise me...</b>

17:52.960 --> 17:54.000
<b>Alicia!</b>

17:57.540 --> 18:00.500
<b>Helck... I-I'm...</b>

18:03.500 --> 18:05.960
<b>N-no! Don't look!</b>

18:05.960 --> 18:08.790
<b>Please! I want you to leave me behind!</b>

18:08.790 --> 18:10.670
<b>I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</b>

18:10.670 --> 18:12.540
<b>Alicia! It's okay!</b>

18:13.000 --> 18:14.420
<b>It's going to be okay!</b>

18:23.040 --> 18:24.460
<b>Helck...</b>

18:25.130 --> 18:28.250
<b>Please use that sword to kill me...</b>

18:28.830 --> 18:31.290
<b>If I'm awakening as a hero...</b>

18:31.290 --> 18:33.830
<b>then Hero Slayer should
make it easy to end my life...</b>

18:34.080 --> 18:35.460
<b>Don't be ridiculous!</b>

18:35.460 --> 18:37.080
<b>There's no way I could do that!</b>

18:37.380 --> 18:39.040
<b>This isn't like you!</b>

18:39.460 --> 18:42.580
<b>You were never the type
to give up so easily!</b>

18:42.580 --> 18:44.500
<b>I don't want to fully awaken.</b>

18:45.920 --> 18:47.460
<b>I want to die...</b>

18:47.460 --> 18:49.500
<b>Please don't talk like that!</b>

18:49.500 --> 18:52.210
<b>I'm begging you! Please!</b>

18:53.920 --> 18:57.710
<b>I can already feel my sanity
slipping away from me...</b>

18:57.710 --> 19:00.210
<b>Any longer and I just know...</b>

19:00.210 --> 19:03.880
<b>I'll end up as one of those monsters
trying to hurt you...</b>

19:03.880 --> 19:06.210
<b>Fine then! Bring it on!</b>

19:06.210 --> 19:08.330
<b>I'll fight you as many times as it takes!</b>

19:08.330 --> 19:09.460
<b>So please!</b>

19:09.460 --> 19:12.130
<b>Please don't tell me that you want to die!</b>

19:25.000 --> 19:30.290
<b>It seems like... everyone takes on
the same form after they awaken...</b>

19:31.000 --> 19:35.500
<b>Which means that...
you won't even know which one I am...</b>

19:36.540 --> 19:39.210
<b>We've been together for years, remember?</b>

19:39.710 --> 19:44.500
<b>So no matter what you look like,
I'll be able to tell it's you for sure.</b>

19:44.710 --> 19:48.380
<b>Alicia... I'm not going to give up yet.</b>

19:48.380 --> 19:52.080
<b>I'll beat those bastards to a pulp
and stop the awakening plan!</b>

19:53.250 --> 19:56.540
<b>Be it the king or whoever.
I'll crush them all.</b>

19:56.540 --> 19:58.670
<b>And end this for good!</b>

20:01.330 --> 20:02.960
<b>So please,</b>

20:02.960 --> 20:06.000
<b>I need to be how
you usually are, Alicia...</b>

20:06.000 --> 20:08.210
<b>and tell me that you're not giving up!</b>

20:08.210 --> 20:09.290
<b>Please.</b>

20:09.540 --> 20:11.290
<b>I have a request...</b>

20:11.960 --> 20:16.130
<b>Will you please...
do just this one thing for me?</b>

20:17.580 --> 20:18.790
<b>What is it?</b>

20:21.080 --> 20:22.960
<b>Please smile!</b>

20:24.750 --> 20:29.920
<b>You know... your smile
is something I really love.</b>

20:30.170 --> 20:34.580
<b>So I want you...
to always be smiling... forever...</b>

20:34.580 --> 20:37.920
<b>I'll do my best to hang in there...</b>

20:37.920 --> 20:40.130
<b>until the very end.</b>

20:40.630 --> 20:42.750
<b>So even if... the day comes...</b>

20:42.750 --> 20:49.750
<b>where I show up and t-try
to fight you... as an enemy...</b>

20:50.580 --> 20:55.670
<b>Please... please let me see your smile...</b>

21:01.960 --> 21:04.380
<b>Okay, I will.</b>

21:04.380 --> 21:06.170
<b>Count on it.</b>

21:06.580 --> 21:07.920
<b>Alicia.</b>

21:10.130 --> 21:11.960
<b>Thank you...</b>

21:12.880 --> 21:14.830
<b>Helck...</b>

21:24.330 --> 21:27.960
<b>Nee, bokura ga egaiteita yume wa nandakke</b>

21:27.960 --> 21:31.170
<b>Nee, bokura ga egaiteita yume wa nandakke</b>

21:31.790 --> 21:35.750
<b>Chiisakute doro darake demo daiji na omoide</b>

21:35.750 --> 21:39.170
<b>Chiisakute doro darake demo daiji na omoide</b>

21:39.920 --> 21:43.630
<b>Migi mo hidari mo wakaranai bukakkou na boku no</b>

21:43.630 --> 21:46.710
<b>Migi mo hidari mo wakaranai bukakkou na boku no</b>

21:47.670 --> 21:54.580
<b>Te o hiite tasukete kureta suzushii manazashi</b>

21:55.670 --> 21:59.540
<b>Daijoubu daijoubutte iinagara</b>

21:59.540 --> 22:03.460
<b>Kimi wa nando mo boku o dakishimeta</b>

22:03.460 --> 22:06.830
<b>Atatakai kono te o kondo wa boku ga nigirunda</b>

22:06.830 --> 22:10.040
<b>Atatakai kono te o kondo wa boku ga nigirunda</b>

22:11.290 --> 22:18.460
<b>Kimi no namae o sakenda sekai wa waratta</b>

22:18.750 --> 22:22.710
<b>Tsunagi tomeru sono kotoba ga nani yori toutoi</b>

22:22.710 --> 22:25.830
<b>Tsunagi tomeru sono kotoba ga nani yori toutoi</b>

22:26.960 --> 22:34.170
<b>Kore ga bokura no unmei naraba nurikaeyou</b>

22:34.420 --> 22:38.420
<b>Kurayami no sono mukou gawa</b>

22:38.420 --> 22:45.420
<b>Tomo ni tsukamaeru hikari</b>

22:46.130 --> 22:50.920
<b>Next Episode</b>

